<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Http on AXLROSE</title><link>https://echotrue.github.io/tags/http/</link><description>Recent content in Http on AXLROSE</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><managingEditor>axlrose.huang@gmail.com (Axlrose)</managingEditor><webMaster>axlrose.huang@gmail.com (Axlrose)</webMaster><copyright>2023 Axlrose rights reserved</copyright><lastBuildDate>Fri, 09 Aug 2024 15:49:15 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://echotrue.github.io/tags/http/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>http.Response.Body未被完全读取的问题</title><link>https://echotrue.github.io/blog/golang/http-response-body/</link><pubDate>Fri, 09 Aug 2024 15:49:15 +0800</pubDate><author>axlrose.huang@gmail.com (Axlrose)</author><guid>https://echotrue.github.io/blog/golang/http-response-body/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;经常在一些开源的包中(例如：&lt;code&gt;dghubble/sling&lt;/code&gt;)处理http响应体的时候出现这么一段代码：&lt;code&gt;defer io.Copy(io.Discard, resp.Body)&lt;/code&gt;。这段代码的作用主要是丢弃掉响应体中的内容。为什么要这么做呢？&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;经过查询http库源代码后看到一段注释.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#abb2bf;background-color:#282c34;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;// Body represents the response body.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;// The response body is streamed on demand as the Body field&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;// is read. If the network connection fails or the server&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;// terminates the response, Body.Read calls return an error.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;// The http Client and Transport guarantee that Body is always&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;// non-nil, even on responses without a body or responses with&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;// a zero-length body. It is the caller&amp;#39;s responsibility to&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;// close Body. The default HTTP client&amp;#39;s Transport may not&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;// reuse HTTP/1.x &amp;#34;keep-alive&amp;#34; TCP connections if the Body is&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;// not read to completion and closed.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;// The Body is automatically dechunked if the server replied&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;// with a &amp;#34;chunked&amp;#34; Transfer-Encoding.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;// As of Go 1.12, the Body will also implement io.Writer&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;// on a successful &amp;#34;101 Switching Protocols&amp;#34; response,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#7f848e"&gt;// as used by WebSockets and HTTP/2&amp;#39;s &amp;#34;h2c&amp;#34; mode.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;Body&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;io&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;ReadCloser&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;下面可以通过一段代码验证这个观点：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#abb2bf;background-color:#282c34;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c678dd"&gt;package&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c678dd"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; (
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#98c379"&gt;&amp;#34;fmt&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#98c379"&gt;&amp;#34;io&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#98c379"&gt;&amp;#34;log&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#98c379"&gt;&amp;#34;net&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#98c379"&gt;&amp;#34;net/http&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#98c379"&gt;&amp;#34;net/http/httptrace&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#98c379"&gt;&amp;#34;time&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; )
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c678dd"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#61afef;font-weight:bold"&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;() {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#61afef;font-weight:bold"&gt;do&lt;/span&gt;()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#c678dd"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;!=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e5c07b"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#61afef;font-weight:bold"&gt;Fatal&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c678dd"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#61afef;font-weight:bold"&gt;do&lt;/span&gt;() &lt;span style="color:#e5c07b"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;client&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;http&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;Client&lt;/span&gt;{
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;Timeout&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#d19a66"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;Second&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;Transport&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;http&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;Transport&lt;/span&gt;{
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;Proxy&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;http&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;ProxyFromEnvironment&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;DialContext&lt;/span&gt;: (&lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;net&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;Dialer&lt;/span&gt;{
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;Timeout&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#d19a66"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;Second&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }).&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;DialContext&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;ForceAttemptHTTP2&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e5c07b"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;MaxIdleConns&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#d19a66"&gt;100&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;MaxIdleConnsPerHost&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#d19a66"&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;IdleConnTimeout&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#d19a66"&gt;10&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;Second&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;TLSHandshakeTimeout&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#d19a66"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;Second&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;ResponseHeaderTimeout&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#d19a66"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;Second&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; },
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;trace&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;httptrace&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;ClientTrace&lt;/span&gt;{
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;GotConn&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#c678dd"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;connInfo&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;httptrace&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;GotConnInfo&lt;/span&gt;) {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#61afef;font-weight:bold"&gt;Printf&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#98c379"&gt;&amp;#34;Got Conn: %+v\n&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;connInfo&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; },
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#61afef;font-weight:bold"&gt;Printf&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#98c379"&gt;&amp;#34;multiGetReadBody:\n&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#c678dd"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#61afef;font-weight:bold"&gt;nultiGetReadBody&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;client&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;trace&lt;/span&gt;); &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;!=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e5c07b"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#c678dd"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;client&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#61afef;font-weight:bold"&gt;CloseIdleConnections&lt;/span&gt;()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#61afef;font-weight:bold"&gt;Printf&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#98c379"&gt;&amp;#34;\nmultiGetNotReadBody:\n&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#c678dd"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#61afef;font-weight:bold"&gt;nultiGetNotReadBody&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;client&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;trace&lt;/span&gt;); &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;!=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e5c07b"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#c678dd"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#c678dd"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e5c07b"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#c678dd"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#61afef;font-weight:bold"&gt;nultiGetReadBody&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;client&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;http&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;Client&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;trace&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;httptrace&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;ClientTrace&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span style="color:#e5c07b"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#c678dd"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#61afef;font-weight:bold"&gt;get&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;client&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;trace&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e5c07b"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;); &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;!=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e5c07b"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#c678dd"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#c678dd"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#61afef;font-weight:bold"&gt;get&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;client&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;trace&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e5c07b"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;); &lt;span style="color:#e06c75"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#56b6c2"&gt;!=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e5c07b"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt; {
